    <string name="step_one_body" formatted="false">Browse-ni oching. Veb-sayt manzilini qidiring yoki kiriting. Shuningdek, siz boshqa ilovadan video havolani baham ko\&apos;rishingiz mumkin.</string>
    <string name="step_two_title" formatted="false">Manbani kashf qiling</string>
    <string name="step_two_body" formatted="false">Videoni ijro eting, so‘ngra Videolarni topish-ga teging. Aniqlangan faylni tanlang yoki to\&apos;g\&apos;ridan-to\&apos;g\&apos;ri HTTPS video havolasini joylashtiring.</string>
    <string name="step_three_title" formatted="false">Uni sizniki qiling</string>
    <string name="step_three_body" formatted="false">Fayl nomini tanlang, videoni saqlashga ruxsatingizni tasdiqlang va Yuklab olish tugmasini bosing. Android fonda yuklab olishni davom ettiradi.</string>
    <string name="step_four_title" formatted="false">To\&apos;plamingizdan bahramand bo\&apos;ling</string>
    <string name="step_four_body" formatted="false">Jarayonni tekshirish uchun Yuklashlarni oching. Tugallangan videolarni ijro eting yoki baham ko\&apos;ring. Zarur bo\&apos;lganda yangi havola bilan muvaffaqiyatsiz yuklab olishlarni qaytadan urinib ko\&apos;ring.</string>
